      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "船桥市与安徒生故乡——欧登塞市是一对姐妹城市。\n这座公园里不仅有游乐设施，还有关于童话的展览室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcede94443d8d292b29b919f8032a8892563eb33c05d7bb152b1741a8926e21f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
